---
import '@fontsource-variable/roboto-serif';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { rates, gbp } from '../data/rates';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Capabilities | Saielle DaSilva"
  description="What Saielle DaSilva does, in plain facts: interim and fractional Chief Product Officer for AI and data products, product building, and AI pilot to production."
>
  <section class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Capabilities</p>
      <h1>What I do, in plain facts.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Short, checkable statements about the work, written so a person or an
        answer engine can quote them. Each one is also on the page it comes
        from.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Who</h2>
      <p>
        Saielle DaSilva is an interim and fractional Chief Product Officer for
        AI and data products, with more than 15 years of product leadership on
        both sides of the bridge between the people who build and the boards
        who fund.
      </p>

      <h2>Where it has been done</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          At Sainsbury's she ran product for AI, data platforms and machine
          learning, and took production AI from a handful of experiments to a
          platform serving over 100 million customers.
        </li>
        <li>
          At Sainsbury's she brought all 26 data engineering teams onto one
          platform, with AI and machine learning in production at scale.
        </li>
        <li>
          At StepStone she led the product and design organisation, where the
          satellite portfolio returned 3.2x.
        </li>
        <li>
          At StepStone she co-authored the group strategy and set the
          principles the roadmaps followed. Three AI products shipped using
          LLMs, some of the earliest LLM products in European recruitment.
        </li>
        <li>She was on the founding team at Cazoo, through to a $7B IPO.</li>
        <li>
          At Cazoo she was the first design hire and hired every researcher and
          designer who came after her. The organisation reached 65 people, with
          five leaders reporting to her.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cazoo's results</h2>
      <p>
        These are Cazoo's results during the years she worked there, not
        figures she produced alone.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Cazoo's revenue grew 267% year on year, to £174.4m, with more than
          39,000 five-star Trustpilot reviews and four new markets (France,
          Germany, Spain, Italy).
        </li>
        <li>
          Cazoo Purchase lifted Cazoo's sales volume by 88% year over year in
          its first year, and then carried 38% of all Cazoo transactions.
        </li>
        <li>
          Cazoo Purchase held its single valuation price in over 97% of cases,
          and sellers it retained repeat-purchased at an average of 22%.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How the work is bought</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="/fractional/">Fractional and interim product leadership</a>:
          typically one or two days a week over three to six months, with a
          minimum of three months, executive stakeholder access, team
          leadership and accountability for delivery.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/forward-deployed/">Product building</a>: embedded with the
          client's team three days a week for four to twelve weeks, working in
          the client's own environment. {gbp(rates.forwardDeployed)} a day. A
          fixed-price two-day pilot is {gbp(rates.fdePilot)}.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/ai-pilot-to-production/">AI pilot to production</a>: a free
          preliminary call, then a block of four to twelve weeks at three days
          a week, to build the smallest real version of an AI pilot on the
          client's own data and systems.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Case studies</h2>
      <p>
        Full case studies are shared personally. To request access, email
        Saielle DaSilva at
        {' '}<a href="mailto:hello@intentionaut.com">hello@intentionaut.com</a>
        {' '}or use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
